    {
      "id": "be-s12m-monopolistic-competition-c3",
      "heading": "The good, the bad and the ugly",
      "explanation_md": "| For | Verdict |\n|---|---|\n| **Consumers (good)** | Product variety |\n| **Society (bad)** | P > MC, excess capacity, unexploited economies of scale |\n| **Managers (ugly)** | P = ATC > minimum average cost, and zero profits in the long run |",
      "example_ids": [],
      "key_terms": [],
      "exam_line": "Good: variety. Bad: P > MC, excess capacity. Ugly: zero long-run profit.",
