    {
      "id": "be-s12m-monopolistic-competition-q-0bd48fe5",
      "type": "long",
      "stem": "Distinguish between perfect competition and monopolistic competition.",
      "options": [],
      "answer": "",
      "accept": [],
      "explanation": "",
      "model_answer_md": "| Basis | Perfect competition | Monopolistic competition |\n|---|---|---|\n| Product | Homogeneous | Differentiated |\n| Firm's demand | Horizontal, price taker (P = MR) | Downward sloping, limited market power |\n| Output rule | P = MC | MR = MC, price from demand, so P > MC |\n| Long run | Zero profit, P = minimum AC, efficient plant size | Zero profit, P = AC above minimum average cost, excess capacity |\n| Entry and exit | Free | Free |",
